# Filter icon

Every filter control uses `FilterIcon` from `src/components/FilterIcon.tsx`.

- Do **not** use Lucide `Filter` (funnel).
- Do **not** put the word “Filter” next to the icon. Icon-only button; `aria-label="Filter …"`.
- Button chrome: square, ~2.35rem, 10px radius (see `.verification-app-filter__btn`).
